                  %msup
                    %mi Sq
                    %mn 1
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Sq^1
            is the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bockstein+homomorphism"} Bockstein homomorphism
            of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/short+exact+sequence"} short exact sequence
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
